OL,3,ATories accuse Burnham of turning No 10
OL,4,Ainto 'joke' after influencer video row
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has been accused of
OL,7,Fturning the UK into "a joke" on the
OL,8,Fworld stage by Conservative leader Kemi
OL,9,FBadenoch, amid a row about social media
OL,10,Fvideos posted from an event in Downing
OL,11,FStreet.
OL,13,FSocial media influencer Max Balegde has
OL,14,Fdeleted a video filmed outside the door
OL,15,Fof Number 10, which was posted on
OL,16,FTikTok, in which he mimed along to
OL,17,Fexplicit lyrics.
OL,19,FBadenoch said it was a "disgrace" that
OL,20,Fthe prime minister allowed 10 Downing
OL,21,FStreet to be "degraded".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
